{"sections":[{"slug":"示性类","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"示性类"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“<span lang=\"zh\">示性类</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“示性类”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">极大环面</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为紧</span> Lie <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, $T$ <span lang=\"zh\">为极大环面</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则有分类空间的映射</span> $BT \\to BG$. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $T$ <span lang=\"zh\">的维数为</span> $n$, <span lang=\"zh\">则有</span> $BT\\simeq \\mathbb{C}P^\\infty\\times \\cdots\\times \\mathbb{C} P^\\infty$,\n$$\r\nH^{**}(BT)\\simeq \\mathbb Z[x_1,\\cdots,x_n](x_1,/cdots,x_n.md),\\ x_i\\in H^2.\r\n$$\nWeyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $\\Phi=N(T)/T$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用在</span> $T$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而也作用在</span> $BT$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>. Borel <span lang=\"zh\">定理指出映射</span>\n$$\r\ni^*\\colon H^{**}(BG)\\to H^{**}(BT)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是单射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且其像恰为</span> $\\Phi$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用的不动点</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h3>\n<p>$H^{*}(BU_n)=\\mathbb{Z}[[c_1,\\cdots,c_n]]$, <span lang=\"zh\">其中</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陈类","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陈类</span>"}},{"Plain":" $c_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $x_1,\\cdots,x_n\\in H^{*}(BT)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">次基本对称多项式</span>.</p>\n<p>$H^{*}(BSp_n)=\\mathbb{Z}[[\\sigma_1,\\cdots,\\sigma_n]]$,\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\sigma_k$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $x_1^2,\\cdots,x_n^2\\in H^{*}(BT)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">次基本对称多项式</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}